### B.1 Key Data Structures

#### ScoredPostsQuery (Client Request)
```rust
struct ScoredPostsQuery {
    user_id: u64,
    cursor: Option<Cursor>,      // pagination token
    count: u32,                  // requested number of posts
    // additional flags (e.g., include_nsfw, safe_search)
}
```

#### PostCandidate
```rust
struct PostCandidate {
    post_id: u64,
    author_id: u64,
    source: CandidateSource,    // Thunder or PhoenixRetrieval
    content: ContentFeatures,
    metadata: PostMetadata,
    // hydratable fields
}
```

#### ScoredCandidate
```rust
struct ScoredCandidate {
    post: PostCandidate,
    score: f64,                 // final weighted score
    action_probabilities: Option<ActionProbabilities>,
    rank: u32,
}
```

#### ActionProbabilities
```rust
struct ActionProbabilities {
    like: f64,
    reply: f64,
    repost: f64,
    quote: f64,
    click: f64,
    profile_visit: f64,
    video_completion: f64,
    dwell_time: f64,            // normalized
    share: f64,
    follow: f64,
    // negative actions
    block: f64,
    mute: f64,
    report: f64,
    not_interested: f64,
    // possibly additional actions (15‑19 total)
}
```

### B.2 gRPC/Protobuf Schemas (Representative)

```protobuf
service ScoredPostsService {
    rpc GetScoredPosts(ScoredPostsRequest) returns (ScoredPostsResponse);
}

message ScoredPostsRequest {
    uint64 user_id = 1;
    Cursor cursor = 2;
    uint32 count = 3;
}

message ScoredPostsResponse {
    repeated ScoredCandidate candidates = 1;
    Cursor next_cursor = 2;
}
```

